# Inputs for requirements-etebase-build.txt. See that file for the full command.
#
# PyPI etebase 0.32.0 has no macOS x86_64 wheel, so the Intel macOS release build
# compiles the hash-pinned PyPI sdist (requirements-etebase-sdist.txt). This is
# that sdist's build-system requirement (maturin>=1.7,<2.0). It is installed only
# into a throwaway virtualenv that builds the etebase wheel with
# --no-build-isolation, never into the environment PyInstaller bundles.
maturin>=1.7,<2.0
